# REQUIRES: python-api, cuda
# Persistent simulations on a GPU (D196), scenario nve of
# Inputs/python_segments.py.
# NVE runs of 1 + 7 + 13 steps, and of 1 x 5 + 3 x 2 + 10, against
# uninterrupted ones, equal to the bit in double and mixed precision
# (D215), and the repeat of a deterministic run bit for bit.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_segments.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide GPU mdir %t nve | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: NVE VelocityVerlet Double: parts of 1+7+13 and of 1x5+3x2+10 equal 21 steps in one part to the bit
# CHECK: NVE VelocityVerlet Mixed: parts of 1+7+13 and of 1x5+3x2+10 equal 21 steps in one part to the bit
# CHECK: segments nve passed
